{"id":"f9e12784e4","t":"The Strongest Romantic","c":"cv","n":36,"l":36,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic"},"u":1795768210010,"desc":"ريو وو جين هو أقوى مقاتل بلا منازع في ثانوية دوبال، أسوأ مدرسة في البلاد. وعلى الرغم من أنه لا يخسر أي نزال يخوضه، فإنه يخفي عن الجميع شغفًا كبيرًا بقصص الحب، ويحلم بأن يصبح مؤلف ويب تون. وبحثًا عن الحب الحقيقي، يقرر وو جين الانتقال إلى مدرسة ثانوية مختلطة عادية. وهناك يأمل أن يجد الإلهام الرومانسي العذب الذي ينشده، ليحوّله إلى تحفة فنية من الويب تون.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["شياطين","كوميدى"],"src":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/16/"},"17":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/17/"},"18":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/18/"},"19":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romantic/19/"},"20":{"ml":"the-strongest-romantic|/manga/the-strongest-romant